      "id": "talk:bythebay-20170504-mleap-scaling-ml-from-research-to-production-hollin-wilkins",
      "properties": {
        "abstract": "MLeap is an open-source technology that allows Data Scientists and Engineers to deploy ML Pipelines and Models trained in Spark, Scikit-Learn and TensorFlow to a scoring engine instantly. MLeap provides serialization of ML Pipelines to an MLeap Bundle, a graph-based serialization framework built on top of Protobuf 3 and JSON.",
